 "transcript": [
  "[action] The eldest son returns from a trip with Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung stands and stares at his son.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a good thing and I am proud of it,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son stands with his back to his father.",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung looks at his son with amazement.",
  "[action] The eldest son eats and looks at his father with indifference.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son invites his father to eat.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What sort of thing is this?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"What sort of thing is this, my second son?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Why did you marry without telling me?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I could not ask you,\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son explains his reasons for marrying.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son asks for money to support his family.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung refuses to give money to his son.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and I am your father and I will not give you money,\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I am your son and I will have what I will have,\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung offers to support his daughter.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now, my son, I will give money for my little granddaughter.\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and she is a pretty little thing and her mother is a pretty woman, and she will be a pretty maid when she grows up and I will give money for her.\""
